   "widgets_values": [
    "DEFINE art test, round 2b (reworded low-end stages)\n\nPress Run once: 6 images.\n\nRow A: build words near the start of the prompt (round 1 structure). A s3_athletic is the control and should match round 1 exactly.\n\nRow B: identical prompt text with the build as the LAST sentence, so everything before it encodes identically.\n\nRow C: same as B, but the physique sentence is in Chinese.\n\nCompare drift (pose, framing, costume, face) and how much the body actually changes.\n\nPaste the results here; seeds are fixed, so screenshots or webp are fine."
   ]
  },
